        "title": "Real Indian Case Studies and Salary Calculator Worksheets",
        "content": "Let us summarize all concepts with 5 detailed Indian real-life job profiles and exact mathematical worksheets.\n\n---\n\n### 16.6.1 Case Study 1: Software Engineer Amit (Rs.15 LPA CTC - Tier 1 Product MNC, Bengaluru)\n\nAmit is a 22-year-old Software Development Engineer (SDE-1) in Bengaluru.\n\n#### Table 16.11: Amit's Rs.15 LPA Detailed Salary Sheet\n\n| Component | Annual (Rs.) | Monthly (Rs.) | Notes / Remarks |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Basic Salary** | Rs.7,50,000 | Rs.62,500 | 50% of CTC |\n| **HRA** | Rs.3,75,000 | Rs.31,250 | 50% of Basic |\n| **Special Allowance** | Rs.1,61,000 | Rs.13,417 | Balance Plug |\n| **LTA** | Rs.30,000 | Rs.2,500 | Claimable via Bills |\n| **Employer EPF (12%)** | Rs.90,000 | Rs.7,500 | 12% of Basic |\n| **Gratuity Pool** | Rs.36,058 | Rs.3,005 | Statutory provision |\n| **Performance Variable Bonus** | Rs.57,942 | Rs.4,828 | Annual Payout (Target 100%) |\n| **TOTAL CTC PACKAGE** | **Rs.15,00,000** | **Rs.1,25,000** | **Gross CTC** |\n\n#### Monthly Take-Home Math for Amit:\n\n- **Gross Monthly Earnings Cash:** Basic (Rs.62.5k) + HRA (Rs.31.25k) + Special Allow (Rs.13.417k) + LTA (Rs.2.5k) = **Rs.1,09,667**\n- **Deductions:**\n - Employee EPF (12%): Rs.7,500\n - Professional Tax: Rs.200\n - TDS (New Tax Regime Option Selected): Approx Rs.8,400 / month\n- **Net Monthly IN-HAND Salary = Rs.1,09,667 - (Rs.7,500 + Rs.200 + Rs.8,400) = Rs.93,567 / month**\n\n> **Insight:** In the Rs.15 LPA CTC package, Amit's actual bank take-home monthly payout is **Rs.93,567**.\n\n---\n\n### 16.6.2 Case Study 2: Management Trainee Shreya (Rs.8 LPA CTC - FMCG Sector, Mumbai)\n\nShreya started as a Management Trainee role at an FMCG company in Mumbai after her MBA.\n\n#### Table 16.12: Shreya's Rs.8 LPA Salary Breakdown and Take-Home\n\n| Component Head | Annual Amount (Rs.) | Monthly Amount (Rs.) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Basic Salary** | Rs.3,20,000 | Rs.26,667 |\n| **HRA** | Rs.1,60,000 | Rs.13,333 |\n| **Special Allowance** | Rs.1,55,200 | Rs.12,933 |\n| **Flexi Benefits** | Rs.60,000 | Rs.5,000 |\n| **Employer EPF** | Rs.38,400 | Rs.3,200 |\n| **Gratuity** | Rs.15,400 | Rs.1,283 |\n| **Variable Pay** | Rs.51,000 | Rs.4,250 |\n| **TOTAL CTC** | **Rs.8,00,000** | **Rs.66,667** |",
